# Paths excluded from ZIP snapshots created by scripts/snapshot.mjs.
# Same shape as .gitignore (one path/glob per line; # comments OK).
#
# Snapshots are PERSONAL recovery archives — the owner sends them to
# their own Teams self-DM and uses them to restore on a new laptop.
# They never leave the owner's control, so credentials (.env,
# client-secrets/, .secrets, CHAT-HANDOFF.md, .cache/) ARE included.
# This is intentional — the whole point of the recovery channel is
# that a laptop swap restores the working brain without re-collecting
# credentials.
#
# What MUST stay included (do not add these here):
#   - .git/         the local git history; without it, branches and
#                   undo are gone on the new machine
#   - .github/      Copilot Custom Instructions live here; without
#                   them the AI surface forgets all repo rules
#   - .env*         per Rule 5 of .github/copilot-instructions.md
#   - client-secrets/  same
#
# Only exclude what would either bloat the ZIP beyond Teams limits
# or recurse on itself.

versions/       # recursion guard — snapshots are stored here
node_modules/   # size: can hit GB; reinstall with npm install

# OS junk (small but noisy when extracting)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
